# Planning

Plans describe **what needs to change** — the settled design, target behavior, and concrete edits.

Do **not** narrate abandoned options, rejected approaches, or “we are not doing X” leftovers from earlier draft iterations. If something is out of scope, omit it unless the reader must know a deliberate deletion or behavior change.

```text
# BAD
No separate grounds_air RuleFlag. We rejected Unlock keys.

# GOOD
Pads grant ThisTile InteractionOverride for attack_unit air/orbital.
```
